		{"id":"intro","type":"text","text":"# Canvas showcase\n\nCards hold **markdown**, notes, images and links.\n\n- [[index]] is the vault's start\n- math renders: $\\int_0^1 x^2\\,dx = \\tfrac13$\n- [ ] a task in a card","x":-420,"y":-80,"width":420,"height":340,"color":"4"},
