		{"id":"spec","type":"link","url":"https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/","x":-40,"y":420,"width":320,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"aside","type":"text","text":"Double-click a file or link card to open it.","x":-40,"y":540,"width":320,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"keys","type":"text","text":"# Keys\n\n| Keys | Action |\n| --- | --- |\n| click, shift click | Pick, add to the pick |\n| drag | Move (alt: off the grid) |\n| drag a corner | Resize |\n| drag on nothing | Box pick |\n| drag a side dot | Connect |\n| double click | Write, open, or a new card |\n| `at` | New text card |\n| `i`, `ret` | Write in the card |\n| `esc` | Keep the text / drop the pick |\n| `C-v` | In the card / beside |\n| `space v` | Split / full |\n| `d`, `del` | Delete |\n| `y` | Duplicate |\n| `ag` | Group |\n| `c1` … `c6`, `c0` | Colour, no colour |\n| `zs`, `zf` | Zoom to the pick, fit |\n| `u`, `U` | Undo, redo |\n| `:w` | Save |","x":-420,"y":700,"width":740,"height":780}
	],
